.mca_resource_pane_title
  Add picture
  
- if selectable.does_have_pictures
  = form_with(model: [:admin, album], url: admin_album_path(album, pane: :pictures), local: true, class: :mca_form) do |f|
    .mca_form_attributes
      = f.fields_for :album_pictures, album.album_pictures.build do |ap|
        = render 'admin/form_fields/picture_select', form: ap, selectable: selectable
    .mca_form_actions
      = f.submit class: :mca_form_submit

- else
  .mca_form
    .mca_form_null No pictures.
